  "description": "Each YITAMOTOR tonneau cover is custom-built to fit your truck perfectly, ensuring an exact and secure fit. Crafted from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl, these covers are engineered to withstand the elements, providing durability and long-lasting performance. Unlike other covers, YITAMOTOR tonneau covers will not stretch, fade, or crack, keeping your truck bed protected and looking sharp for years to come.\nFitment\nfor 2002-2026 Ram 1500 New body 6.4ft (2019-2024 Classic & 2019-2026 New Body)\nfor 2003-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 / 3500 6.4ft\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for Your Truck: YITAMOTOR truck tonneau cover is designed to fit for Dodge Ram 1500 2002-2026 (2019-2024 Classic & 2019-2026 New Body), fit for Dodge Ram 2500 3500 2003-2026 w/o Rambox with a 6.4ft bed, transforming your pickup bed into a sleek shield\nAll-Round Protection: Shield your pickup bed from rain, snow, dust, and debris with this truck bed cover; Whether you're hauling gear on a rugged adventure or driving through stormy weather, it ensures your cargo stays safe and dry\nHeavy-Duty Strength: Built tough, this quad-fold bed cover boasts heavy-duty aluminum alloy with powder-coated frames; Each crossbar is designed for unmatched security and stability, preventing air lifting for a rock-solid ride\nSpace-Saving Design: Unlike bulky alternatives, this pickup bed cover's quad-fold design offers a space-saving solution for your truck bed; Quickly access your gear by folding up the cover without losing valuable space\nCargo Storage Securing: Hard quad-fold tonneau cover provides extra protection for your truck bed contents, helping prevent theft and damage",
